  "instructions": [
    "Bring the chicken broth to a boil in a large pot",
    "Add the dashi extract and stir to combine",
    "Add the ground pork and cook until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks",
    "Add the sliced onion and minced garlic and cook until the onion is translucent",
    "Add the egg noodles and cook according to the package instructions",
    "Stir in the sriracha sauce and caraway seeds",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes",
    "Serve hot and enjoy"
